{"title": "Coin Vambrace (L) (Condition)", "pageid": 34316, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Coin_Vambrace_(L)_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/30px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/45px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/60px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gold Pile Medium Item Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/30px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Coin Vambrace (L)</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Cursed coins have gathered around the Toll Collector's left arm, increasing her overall health by 100.</li>\n<li>Additionally, she can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Left_Coin_Whip\" title=\"Left Coin Whip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Left Coin Whip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Left_Coin_Whip\" title=\"Left Coin Whip\">Left Coin Whip</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">TWN_TOLLHOUSE_BUFF_01</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TWN_TOLLHOUSE_BUFF_01+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TWN_TOLLHOUSE_BUFF_01+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Left_Coin_Whip\" title=\"Left Coin Whip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Left Coin Whip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Left_Coin_Whip\" title=\"Left Coin Whip\">Left Coin Whip</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Whip a target with jingle-jangling fury. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn.)</dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The first <a href=\"/wiki/Grim_Visage\" title=\"Grim Visage\">Grim Visage</a> destroyed will remove this piece of armour.</li>\n<li>Alternatively, this condition will be removed after Gerringothe Thorm is reduced to less than 507 hit points.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Creatures_with_Coin_Vambrace_.28L.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Coin_Vambrace_(L)\">Creatures with Coin Vambrace (L)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/30px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/45px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/60px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gerringothe Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/30px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Increase overall health by 100 and gain <a href=\"/wiki/Left_Coin_Whip\" title=\"Left Coin Whip\">Left Coin Whip</a></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1731/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 226